062945987300473", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_5062945993967139_3191845456349320077_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4TmA1OUAPnsQ7kNvwEx5f8y&_nc_oc=AdqRKQX72S8BzYqKI3lvkDQOrOTukBb14BvliTYZ9mI0RpTlVkv-TudOCosV-BnRsdQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGxDtNPWiS7JUyTL5wQpKHeshoA8jtkUbbSt0DqVIOu-A&oe=6A8587C9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "KillianVR", "keywords": ["killian", "movement", "parkour", "hangout", "adventure"], "long_description": "Become a Killian and walk on walls, shop for cosmetics, explore different maps and much more in KillianVR! \n\n---Things you can do in KillianVR (So Far)---\n\n- Put both hands on a wall and your camera should \"shift\" to that direction \n\n- Go to the shop located in Forest and buy cosmetics with Bamboo \n\n- You can earn Bamboo by breaking breakables in different maps\n\n- You can access the Menu by pressing the \"X\" button on your left controller\n\n- You can chat with other people and socialize \n\n- NOTE: their is so much more coming to the game, so enjoy!", "short_description": "Become a Killian and walk on walls, shop for cosmetics, explore different maps and much more in KillianVR!"}]}, "developer_name": "Killian", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1iFFmMZ-ex7_ULHvjocnEnTg9T27wkMnlAtNsatqquts/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1QCWf-Oik9hTnbXQimammHu8JSpttAIU9k048TvoggeY/edit?usp=sharing", "publisher_name": "Killian", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/killianvr/terms-of-service", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}]